1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:02,620
("Ride of the Valkyries" plays)

2
00:00:05,830 --> 00:00:07,630
(Penny:)This ain't no Beyonce.

3
00:00:11,570 --> 00:00:13,630
(Todd:)Now what?

4
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:16,440
(Penny:)Give my friend his stuff back.

5
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:18,300
(Leonard:)I don't know
what you're talking about.

6
00:00:18,310 --> 00:00:19,770
(Penny:)Well, then, good news.

7
00:00:19,770 --> 00:00:21,810
(Penny:)Today's the day a girl's
finally going to touch you

8
00:00:21,810 --> 00:00:23,210
(Penny:)in your little special place.

9
00:00:23,210 --> 00:00:24,810
(exclaims)
(groans)

10
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:28,980
(Penny:)Now give him his stuff back.

11
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:30,520
(Leonard:)Okay.

12
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:31,980
(Sheldon:)We did it!

13
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:36,410
I said, "we."

14
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:45,590
PRIYA:
Oh, hold the door.

15
00:00:45,590 --> 00:00:47,260
- Oh, hi.
- Hi.

16
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:48,120
(clears throat)

17
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:48,970
(Penny:)Going to see Leonard?

18
00:00:48,970 --> 00:00:50,940
(Sheldon:)Yes.

19
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:52,290
(Priya:)How have you been?

20
00:00:52,290 --> 00:00:53,670
(Penny:)Fine. You?

21
00:00:53,670 --> 00:01:35,020
(Priya:)Very well, thank you.

